Looking back at eight episodes from 2026 May 25th to 2026 May 31st,

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.200
the stories that mattered, what we learned, and what to watch next.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:46.980
The NASDAQ Composite closed the week at 26,973, up 0.2% on the day.

