00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:06.840
These outcomes remind us that contract wins alone do not guarantee price stability once macro headwinds appear.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:12.360
The lesson is to pair catalyst strength with sector momentum checks before sizing up.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:20.340
Our earlier rule about waiting for volume confirmation would have helped here because both names saw light trading after the initial news.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:27.980
